### Sahajanand Electronics API — HTTP Requests
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api
### Replace {{TOKEN}} with a valid Firebase ID token
### Replace {{ADMIN_TOKEN}} with an admin user's token

# ─── Health ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

# ─── Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login (Firebase token in header)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Get Current User
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

# ─── Users ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Update Profile
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}

# ─── Categories ──────────────────────────────────────────

### List Categories
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories

### Get Category by Slug
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories/refrigerators

# ─── Products ────────────────────────────────────────────

### List Products (with filters)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?page=1&limit=12&sort=newest

### Search Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?search=samsung

### Filter by Category
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?category=refrigerators

### Filter by Price Range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?minPrice=10000&maxPrice=30000

### Filter In-Stock + Featured
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?inStock=true&featured=true

### Featured Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/featured

### New Arrivals
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/new-arrivals

### Get Brands
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/brands

### Get Product by Slug
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/samsung-253l-double-door-frost-free-refrigerator

# ─── Addresses ───────────────────────────────────────────

### List Addresses
GET http://localhost:5000/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Create Address
POST http://localhost:5000/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Denish Patel",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "line1": "123 Main Street",
  "line2": "Near City Mall",
  "landmark": "Opposite Park",
  "city": "Ahmedabad",
  "state": "Gujarat",
  "pincode": "380001",
  "type": "home",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Update Address
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/addresses/{{ADDRESS_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Updated Name",
  "phone": "9123456789"
}

### Set Default Address
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/addresses/{{ADDRESS_ID}}/default
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Delete Address
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/addresses/{{ADDRESS_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

# ─── Cart ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get Cart
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Add to Cart
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{PRODUCT_ID}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Update Cart Item Quantity
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items/{{PRODUCT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Remove Cart Item
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items/{{PRODUCT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Clear Cart
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Merge Guest Cart
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{PRODUCT_ID}}", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

# ─── Wishlist ────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get Wishlist
GET http://localhost:5000/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Add to Wishlist
POST http://localhost:5000/api/wishlist/{{PRODUCT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Remove from Wishlist
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/wishlist/{{PRODUCT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

# ─── Coupons ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Validate Coupon
POST http://localhost:5000/api/coupons/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME10",
  "itemsTotal": 15000
}

# ─── Reviews ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get Product Reviews
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reviews/product/{{PRODUCT_ID}}?page=1

### Create Review
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reviews/product/{{PRODUCT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "title": "Excellent product!",
  "comment": "Great value for money. Works perfectly."
}

### Update Review
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reviews/{{REVIEW_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Updated review text"
}

### Delete Review
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/reviews/{{REVIEW_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

# ─── Orders ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Checkout (COD, from cart)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": "{{ADDRESS_ID}}",
  "paymentMethod": "cod"
}

### Checkout (Razorpay, buy now)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": "{{ADDRESS_ID}}",
  "paymentMethod": "razorpay",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{PRODUCT_ID}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponCode": "WELCOME10"
}

### My Orders
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/my?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Get Order
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/{{ORDER_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Cancel Order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/{{ORDER_ID}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Changed my mind"
}

### Get Invoice
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/{{ORDER_ID}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

# ─── Payments ────────────────────────────────────────────

### Verify Payment
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_xxx",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_xxx",
  "razorpay_signature": "sig_xxx"
}

### Report Payment Failure
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/failed
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_xxx"
}

### Retry Payment
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/retry/{{ORDER_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

# ─── Admin: Dashboard ────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard Stats
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

# ─── Admin: Products ─────────────────────────────────────

### List Products (admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Create Product
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Electronic Item",
  "category": "{{CATEGORY_ID}}",
  "price": 15000,
  "mrp": 19000,
  "stock": 25,
  "brand": "TestBrand",
  "description": "A detailed description",
  "features": ["Feature 1", "Feature 2"],
  "tags": ["electronics", "new"],
  "isFeatured": true
}

### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products/{{PRODUCT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 14000,
  "stock": 30
}

### Update Stock
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products/{{PRODUCT_ID}}/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 50
}

### Toggle Product Active
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products/{{PRODUCT_ID}}/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products/{{PRODUCT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

# ─── Admin: Orders ───────────────────────────────────────

### List Orders (with filters)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/orders?status=placed&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Update Order Status
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/orders/{{ORDER_ID}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed",
  "note": "Order verified and confirmed"
}

### Ship Order
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/orders/{{ORDER_ID}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "shipped",
  "trackingId": "TRACK123456",
  "courierName": "Delhivery"
}

### Mark COD as Paid
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/orders/{{ORDER_ID}}/payment-status
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentStatus": "paid"
}

### Refund Order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/orders/{{ORDER_ID}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 0
}

# ─── Admin: Users ────────────────────────────────────────

### List Users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/users?page=1&search=test
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Get User Detail
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Change User Role
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### Deactivate User
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

# ─── Admin: Coupons ──────────────────────────────────────

### List Coupons
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Create Coupon
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NEWCOUPON20",
  "description": "20% off on all orders",
  "discountType": "percent",
  "discountValue": 20,
  "maxDiscount": 3000,
  "minOrderValue": 5000,
  "usageLimit": 100,
  "perUserLimit": 1,
  "expiresAt": "2027-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Delete Coupon
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/admin/coupons/{{COUPON_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

# ─── Admin: Reviews ──────────────────────────────────────

### List All Reviews
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/reviews?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Toggle Review Approval
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/reviews/{{REVIEW_ID}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Delete Review
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/admin/reviews/{{REVIEW_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

# ─── Admin: Payments ─────────────────────────────────────

### List Payments
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/payments?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
